+++ /mnt/data/rc12src/README.md	2026-09-30 07:16:05.919696665 +0000
@@ -1,4 +1,21 @@
-# Tank Config v1.1.0 RC11
+# Tank Config v1.1.0 RC12
+
+## RC12 immediate Maelstrom binding fix
+
+RC11's log identified the remaining delay.  The Maelstrom four-magazine
+discovery code used the *currently selected target* as its maximum accepted live
+value.  If the tank still had 8 spare Gatling belts while the new target was 5,
+the entire TD-110 cluster was rejected.  Missile/smoke live corrections could
+therefore wait until Gatling reloads consumed enough belts.
+
+RC12 uses the supported Mod Options ranges only as discovery sanity ceilings
+(600 rounds, 12 spare belts, 40 smoke, 20 missiles per rear launcher).  Once the
+unique TD-110 layout is identified, the configured target is still what gets
+applied.  The HUD decoder uses the same principle, so an older live ammo state
+can be bound and displayed immediately rather than waiting for consumption.
+
+No recurring whole-pool scan was reintroduced.
+
 
 ## RC11 Maelstrom driver-HUD live telemetry fix
 
